								</Symbol>
								<Symbol>
									<Name>nStatesRaw</Name>
									<Comment><![CDATA[State word exactly as served on the wire. Bit 0 connected, bits 1 to 5 battery type, bits 6 to 9 battery level.]]></Comment>
